{"id":"0c35680c0004f5e2","group":"20","path":"20/20-df-formula.md","title":"有签名的一阶项与公式","display":"df-formula — 有签名的一阶项与公式","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)","book_abbrev":"20","label":"20-df-formula","aliases":["20-df-formula"],"display":"df-formula — 有签名的一阶项与公式","chapter":"10","section":"10.1","source_kind":"local-formalization","verification_status":"reviewed","source_reference":"§10.1 的有效 Gödel 编码约定；Notation（印刷 xxxi–xxxii）的有限对象编码；编码接口与语法递归为本地展开","source_pdf_pages":[215],"source_printed_pages":["xxxi","xxxii",183],"depends_on":["[[20-df-strings]]","[[20-df-computable]]","[[20-df-recursive]]","[[20-df-finite-sequence-code]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"20"},{"key":"label","html":"20-df-formula"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>20-df-formula</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-formula — 有签名的一阶项与公式"},{"key":"chapter","html":"10"},{"key":"section","html":"10.1"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"reviewed"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"§10.1 的有效 Gödel 编码约定；Notation（印刷 xxxi–xxxii）的有限对象编码；编码接口与语法递归为本地展开"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>215</span></div>"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>xxxi</span><span>xxxii</span><span>183</span></div>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"755e421576224435\" href=\"?note=755e421576224435\" title=\"20-df-strings\">20-df-strings</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"e343870c773cb68e\" href=\"?note=e343870c773cb68e\" title=\"20-df-computable\">20-df-computable</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"d6dc5974baa6f8a5\" href=\"?note=d6dc5974baa6f8a5\" title=\"20-df-recursive\">20-df-recursive</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"9885f96cf9cb2fff\" href=\"?note=9885f96cf9cb2fff\" title=\"20-df-finite-sequence-code\">20-df-finite-sequence-code</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L=(F,R,a_F,a_R)\">\\(\\mathcal L=(F,R,a_F,a_R)\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F,R,\\mathrm{Var}\">\\(F,R,\\mathrm{Var}\\)</span> 与逻辑标签两两不交，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Var}=\\{v_i:i\\in\\omega\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Var}=\\{v_i:i\\in\\omega\\}\\)</span> 且变量标签互异。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a_F:F\\to\\omega\">\\(a_F:F\\to\\omega\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a_R:R\\to\\omega\">\\(a_R:R\\to\\omega\\)</span> 的计算性通过下列编码参数解释。以下语法树和编码均相对于这个固定的语言。构造子按标签区分、单射且像互不相交；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathscr T\">\\(\\mathscr T\\)</span> 是这些标签上的全部有限有序语法树。</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t,u,u_0,u_1,t_i\\in\\operatorname{Term}(\\mathcal L)\">\\(t,u,u_0,u_1,t_i\\in\\operatorname{Term}(\\mathcal L)\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\phi,\\psi\\in\\operatorname{Form}(\\mathcal L)\">\\(\\phi,\\psi\\in\\operatorname{Form}(\\mathcal L)\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v,w,z\\in\\mathrm{Var}\">\\(v,w,z\\in\\mathrm{Var}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\\in F\">\\(f\\in F\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r\\in R\">\\(r\\in R\\)</span>。变量视为单节点语法树。各交集均在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal P(\\mathscr T)\">\\(\\mathcal P(\\mathscr T)\\)</span> 内取值。FV、AV 与 Ren 的递归参数是有限语法树；替换递归按下述 sz 的自然数值进行。</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\neg\\phi\">\\(\\neg\\phi\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\phi\\to\\psi\">\\(\\phi\\to\\psi\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\forall v\\phi\">\\(\\forall v\\phi\\)</span> 和 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t=u\">\\(t=u\\)</span> 分别表示语法树构造子 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(\\neg,\\phi)\">\\((\\neg,\\phi)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(\\to,\\phi,\\psi)\">\\((\\to,\\phi,\\psi)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(\\forall,v,\\phi)\">\\((\\forall,v,\\phi)\\)</span> 和 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(=,t,u)\">\\((=,t,u)\\)</span>。对有限 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E\\subseteq\\omega\">\\(E\\subseteq\\omega\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(v_i)_{i\\in E}^{\\uparrow}\">\\((v_i)_{i\\in E}^{\\uparrow}\\)</span> 按自然数升序列出。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vec w\\in\\mathrm{Var}^{&lt;\\omega}\">\\(\\vec w\\in\\mathrm{Var}^{&lt;\\omega}\\)</span>。Ren 只在 z 不在待处理公式的 AV 中的替换分支用于改名；其一般递归本身仍是全定义的语法操作。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"755e421576224435\" href=\"?note=755e421576224435\" title=\"20-df-strings\">20-df-strings</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"e343870c773cb68e\" href=\"?note=e343870c773cb68e\" title=\"20-df-computable\">20-df-computable</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"d6dc5974baa6f8a5\" href=\"?note=d6dc5974baa6f8a5\" title=\"20-df-recursive\">20-df-recursive</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"9885f96cf9cb2fff\" href=\"?note=9885f96cf9cb2fff\" title=\"20-df-finite-sequence-code\">20-df-finite-sequence-code</a>。</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Lambda=\\{\\neg,\\to,\\forall,=\\}\">\\(\\Lambda=\\{\\neg,\\to,\\forall,=\\}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma=F\\cup R\\cup\\mathrm{Var}\\cup\\Lambda\">\\(\\Gamma=F\\cup R\\cup\\mathrm{Var}\\cup\\Lambda\\)</span>。固定一组满足下列有效性条件的编码单射 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\iota:\\Gamma\\hookrightarrow\\omega\">\\(\\iota:\\Gamma\\hookrightarrow\\omega\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa:\\mathscr T\\hookrightarrow\\omega\">\\(\\kappa:\\mathscr T\\hookrightarrow\\omega\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\iota(a)\">\\(\\iota(a)\\)</span> 是单个符号 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a\">\\(a\\)</span> 的自然数代码，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa(\\xi)\">\\(\\kappa(\\xi)\\)</span> 是整棵有限语法树 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\xi\">\\(\\xi\\)</span> 的自然数代码；二者是本条在此引入的环境参数，不由前置的有限串或序列编码定义自动确定。本条不指定每个符号或语法树的具体编号。</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf N:\\Gamma\\times\\mathscr T^{&lt;\\omega}\\to\\mathscr T\">\\(\\mathsf N:\\Gamma\\times\\mathscr T^{&lt;\\omega}\\to\\mathscr T\\)</span> 表示有限有序语法树的根与子树构造子：根标签为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a\\in\\Gamma\">\\(a\\in\\Gamma\\)</span>，直接子树按 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vec\\xi\\in\\mathscr T^{&lt;\\omega}\">\\(\\vec\\xi\\in\\mathscr T^{&lt;\\omega}\\)</span> 的次序排列。每棵树有唯一的这种根与子树分解，且</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{gathered}\n\\mathsf N(v,())=v,\\qquad\n\\mathsf N(f,(t_i)_{i&lt;a_F(f)})=(f,(t_i)_{i&lt;a_F(f)}),\\qquad\n\\mathsf N(r,(t_i)_{i&lt;a_R(r)})=(r,(t_i)_{i&lt;a_R(r)}),\\\\\n\\mathsf N(=,(t,u))=(=,t,u),\\qquad\n\\mathsf N(\\neg,(\\phi))=(\\neg,\\phi),\\\\\n\\mathsf N(\\to,(\\phi,\\psi))=(\\to,\\phi,\\psi),\\qquad\n\\mathsf N(\\forall,(v,\\phi))=(\\forall,v,\\phi).\n\\end{gathered}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{gathered}\n\\mathsf N(v,())=v,\\qquad\n\\mathsf N(f,(t_i)_{i&lt;a_F(f)})=(f,(t_i)_{i&lt;a_F(f)}),\\qquad\n\\mathsf N(r,(t_i)_{i&lt;a_R(r)})=(r,(t_i)_{i&lt;a_R(r)}),\\\\\n\\mathsf N(=,(t,u))=(=,t,u),\\qquad\n\\mathsf N(\\neg,(\\phi))=(\\neg,\\phi),\\\\\n\\mathsf N(\\to,(\\phi,\\psi))=(\\to,\\phi,\\psi),\\qquad\n\\mathsf N(\\forall,(v,\\phi))=(\\forall,v,\\phi).\n\\end{gathered}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>给定数值函数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\nu,\\alpha_F,\\alpha_R,\\mathsf{root},\\mathsf{children}\\in\\mathcal C_1^{\\mathrm{tot}}\">\\(\\nu,\\alpha_F,\\alpha_R,\\mathsf{root},\\mathsf{children}\\in\\mathcal C_1^{\\mathrm{tot}}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{build}\\in\\mathcal C_2^{\\mathrm{tot}}\">\\(\\mathsf{build}\\in\\mathcal C_2^{\\mathrm{tot}}\\)</span>。它们与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\iota,\\kappa\">\\(\\iota,\\kappa\\)</span> 共同固定，分别提供变量编号、函数符号元数、关系符号元数、根标签、子树列表和树构造的有效接口。所有参数须同时满足以下条件；任意单射若不满足这些条件，就不属于本条允许的编码。</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{gathered}\n\\iota[F],\\ \\iota[R],\\ \\iota[\\mathrm{Var}],\\ \\iota[\\Lambda],\\ \\kappa[\\mathscr T]\\in\\mathcal R,\\\\\n\\forall i\\in\\omega\\ [\\nu(i)=\\iota(v_i)],\\qquad\n\\forall f\\in F\\ [\\alpha_F(\\iota(f))=a_F(f)],\\qquad\n\\forall r\\in R\\ [\\alpha_R(\\iota(r))=a_R(r)],\\\\\n\\forall m\\in\\omega\\ \\forall a\\in\\Gamma\\ \\forall(\\xi_i)_{i&lt;m}\\in\\mathscr T^m\\\n\\left[\\begin{gathered}\n\\mathsf{build}\\bigl(\\iota(a),\\operatorname{seqcode}((\\kappa(\\xi_i))_{i&lt;m})\\bigr)\n=\\kappa(\\mathsf N(a,(\\xi_i)_{i&lt;m})),\\\\\n\\mathsf{root}(\\kappa(\\mathsf N(a,(\\xi_i)_{i&lt;m})))=\\iota(a),\\\\\n\\mathsf{children}(\\kappa(\\mathsf N(a,(\\xi_i)_{i&lt;m})))\n=\\operatorname{seqcode}((\\kappa(\\xi_i))_{i&lt;m})\n\\end{gathered}\\right].\n\\end{gathered}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{gathered}\n\\iota[F],\\ \\iota[R],\\ \\iota[\\mathrm{Var}],\\ \\iota[\\Lambda],\\ \\kappa[\\mathscr T]\\in\\mathcal R,\\\\\n\\forall i\\in\\omega\\ [\\nu(i)=\\iota(v_i)],\\qquad\n\\forall f\\in F\\ [\\alpha_F(\\iota(f))=a_F(f)],\\qquad\n\\forall r\\in R\\ [\\alpha_R(\\iota(r))=a_R(r)],\\\\\n\\forall m\\in\\omega\\ \\forall a\\in\\Gamma\\ \\forall(\\xi_i)_{i&lt;m}\\in\\mathscr T^m\\\n\\left[\\begin{gathered}\n\\mathsf{build}\\bigl(\\iota(a),\\operatorname{seqcode}((\\kappa(\\xi_i))_{i&lt;m})\\bigr)\n=\\kappa(\\mathsf N(a,(\\xi_i)_{i&lt;m})),\\\\\n\\mathsf{root}(\\kappa(\\mathsf N(a,(\\xi_i)_{i&lt;m})))=\\iota(a),\\\\\n\\mathsf{children}(\\kappa(\\mathsf N(a,(\\xi_i)_{i&lt;m})))\n=\\operatorname{seqcode}((\\kappa(\\xi_i))_{i&lt;m})\n\\end{gathered}\\right].\n\\end{gathered}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>这些数值函数在全部自然数输入上全定义；上式只约束对应有效语法数据的输入，无效输入上的输出不解释为语法对象。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{seqcode}\">\\(\\operatorname{seqcode}\\)</span> 采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"9885f96cf9cb2fff\" href=\"?note=9885f96cf9cb2fff\" title=\"20-df-finite-sequence-code\">20-df-finite-sequence-code</a> 中的具体递归编码，只把已经得到的自然数代码排成有限列表；它不负责选择 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\iota\">\\(\\iota\\)</span> 或 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\">\\(\\kappa\\)</span>。同一语言上的下游语法计算沿用本条选定的整组编码及算法，不在计算过程中另换编号；改变语言时，须对相应的符号集与语法树重新明确这组参数的实例。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}formula}\\vdash\n\\begin{gathered}\n\\operatorname{Term}(\\mathcal L):=\\bigcap\\{T\\subseteq\\mathscr T:\n\\mathrm{Var}\\subseteq T\\land\n\\forall f\\in F\\ \\forall(t_i)_{i&lt;a_F(f)}\\in T^{a_F(f)}\\\n[(f,(t_i))\\in T]\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{Atom}(\\mathcal L):=\n\\{(=,t,u):t,u\\in\\operatorname{Term}(\\mathcal L)\\}\n\\cup\\{(r,(t_i)):r\\in R,\\ (t_i)\\in\\operatorname{Term}(\\mathcal L)^{a_R(r)}\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{Form}(\\mathcal L):=\\bigcap\\{S\\subseteq\\mathscr T:\n\\operatorname{Atom}(\\mathcal L)\\subseteq S\\land\n\\forall\\phi,\\psi\\in S\\ \\forall v\\in\\mathrm{Var}\\\n[(\\neg,\\phi),(\\to,\\phi,\\psi),(\\forall,v,\\phi)\\in S]\\}.\n\\end{gathered}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}formula}\\vdash\n\\begin{gathered}\n\\operatorname{Term}(\\mathcal L):=\\bigcap\\{T\\subseteq\\mathscr T:\n\\mathrm{Var}\\subseteq T\\land\n\\forall f\\in F\\ \\forall(t_i)_{i&lt;a_F(f)}\\in T^{a_F(f)}\\\n[(f,(t_i))\\in T]\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{Atom}(\\mathcal L):=\n\\{(=,t,u):t,u\\in\\operatorname{Term}(\\mathcal L)\\}\n\\cup\\{(r,(t_i)):r\\in R,\\ (t_i)\\in\\operatorname{Term}(\\mathcal L)^{a_R(r)}\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{Form}(\\mathcal L):=\\bigcap\\{S\\subseteq\\mathscr T:\n\\operatorname{Atom}(\\mathcal L)\\subseteq S\\land\n\\forall\\phi,\\psi\\in S\\ \\forall v\\in\\mathrm{Var}\\\n[(\\neg,\\phi),(\\to,\\phi,\\psi),(\\forall,v,\\phi)\\in S]\\}.\n\\end{gathered}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{gathered}\n\\operatorname{FV}(v):=\\{v\\},\\qquad\n\\operatorname{FV}((f,(t_i)_{i&lt;a_F(f)})):=\\bigcup_{i&lt;a_F(f)}\\operatorname{FV}(t_i),\\\\\n\\operatorname{FV}((=,t,u)):=\\operatorname{FV}(t)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}(u),\\qquad\n\\operatorname{FV}((r,(t_i)_{i&lt;a_R(r)})):=\\bigcup_{i&lt;a_R(r)}\\operatorname{FV}(t_i),\\\\\n\\operatorname{FV}(\\neg\\phi):=\\operatorname{FV}(\\phi),\\quad\n\\operatorname{FV}(\\phi\\to\\psi):=\\operatorname{FV}(\\phi)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}(\\psi),\\quad\n\\operatorname{FV}(\\forall v\\phi):=\\operatorname{FV}(\\phi)\\setminus\\{v\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{Sent}(\\mathcal L):=\\{\\phi\\in\\operatorname{Form}(\\mathcal L):\\operatorname{FV}(\\phi)=\\varnothing\\},\\\\\n\\phi\\land\\psi:=(\\neg,(\\to,\\phi,(\\neg,\\psi))),\\qquad\n\\phi\\lor\\psi:=(\\to,(\\neg,\\phi),\\psi),\\\\\n\\exists v\\phi:=(\\neg,(\\forall,v,(\\neg,\\phi))),\\qquad\n\\phi\\leftrightarrow\\psi:=(\\phi\\to\\psi)\\land(\\psi\\to\\phi),\\qquad\n(t\\ne u):=\\neg(t=u).\n\\end{gathered}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{gathered}\n\\operatorname{FV}(v):=\\{v\\},\\qquad\n\\operatorname{FV}((f,(t_i)_{i&lt;a_F(f)})):=\\bigcup_{i&lt;a_F(f)}\\operatorname{FV}(t_i),\\\\\n\\operatorname{FV}((=,t,u)):=\\operatorname{FV}(t)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}(u),\\qquad\n\\operatorname{FV}((r,(t_i)_{i&lt;a_R(r)})):=\\bigcup_{i&lt;a_R(r)}\\operatorname{FV}(t_i),\\\\\n\\operatorname{FV}(\\neg\\phi):=\\operatorname{FV}(\\phi),\\quad\n\\operatorname{FV}(\\phi\\to\\psi):=\\operatorname{FV}(\\phi)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}(\\psi),\\quad\n\\operatorname{FV}(\\forall v\\phi):=\\operatorname{FV}(\\phi)\\setminus\\{v\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{Sent}(\\mathcal L):=\\{\\phi\\in\\operatorname{Form}(\\mathcal L):\\operatorname{FV}(\\phi)=\\varnothing\\},\\\\\n\\phi\\land\\psi:=(\\neg,(\\to,\\phi,(\\neg,\\psi))),\\qquad\n\\phi\\lor\\psi:=(\\to,(\\neg,\\phi),\\psi),\\\\\n\\exists v\\phi:=(\\neg,(\\forall,v,(\\neg,\\phi))),\\qquad\n\\phi\\leftrightarrow\\psi:=(\\phi\\to\\psi)\\land(\\psi\\to\\phi),\\qquad\n(t\\ne u):=\\neg(t=u).\n\\end{gathered}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{gathered}\n\\operatorname{AV}(v):=\\{v\\},\\quad\n\\operatorname{AV}((f,(t_i))):=\\bigcup_i\\operatorname{AV}(t_i),\\\\\n\\operatorname{AV}((=,t,u)):=\\operatorname{AV}(t)\\cup\\operatorname{AV}(u),\\quad\n\\operatorname{AV}((r,(t_i))):=\\bigcup_i\\operatorname{AV}(t_i),\\\\\n\\operatorname{AV}(\\neg\\phi):=\\operatorname{AV}(\\phi),\\quad\n\\operatorname{AV}(\\phi\\to\\psi):=\\operatorname{AV}(\\phi)\\cup\\operatorname{AV}(\\psi),\\quad\n\\operatorname{AV}(\\forall v\\phi):=\\{v\\}\\cup\\operatorname{AV}(\\phi),\\\\\n\\operatorname{Fresh}(E):=v_{\\min\\{i\\in\\omega:v_i\\notin E\\}}\n\\quad(E\\subseteq\\mathrm{Var},\\ |E|&lt;\\omega),\\\\\n\\operatorname{FreeFor}(t,v,\\theta)\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\top\n\\quad(\\theta\\in\\operatorname{Atom}(\\mathcal L)),\\\\\n\\operatorname{FreeFor}(t,v,\\neg\\phi)\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\operatorname{FreeFor}(t,v,\\phi),\\\\\n\\operatorname{FreeFor}(t,v,\\phi\\to\\psi)\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\\n\\operatorname{FreeFor}(t,v,\\phi)\\land\\operatorname{FreeFor}(t,v,\\psi),\\\\\n\\operatorname{FreeFor}(t,v,\\forall w\\phi)\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\\nv=w\\lor v\\notin\\operatorname{FV}(\\phi)\\lor\n(w\\notin\\operatorname{FV}(t)\\land\\operatorname{FreeFor}(t,v,\\phi)).\n\\end{gathered}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{gathered}\n\\operatorname{AV}(v):=\\{v\\},\\quad\n\\operatorname{AV}((f,(t_i))):=\\bigcup_i\\operatorname{AV}(t_i),\\\\\n\\operatorname{AV}((=,t,u)):=\\operatorname{AV}(t)\\cup\\operatorname{AV}(u),\\quad\n\\operatorname{AV}((r,(t_i))):=\\bigcup_i\\operatorname{AV}(t_i),\\\\\n\\operatorname{AV}(\\neg\\phi):=\\operatorname{AV}(\\phi),\\quad\n\\operatorname{AV}(\\phi\\to\\psi):=\\operatorname{AV}(\\phi)\\cup\\operatorname{AV}(\\psi),\\quad\n\\operatorname{AV}(\\forall v\\phi):=\\{v\\}\\cup\\operatorname{AV}(\\phi),\\\\\n\\operatorname{Fresh}(E):=v_{\\min\\{i\\in\\omega:v_i\\notin E\\}}\n\\quad(E\\subseteq\\mathrm{Var},\\ |E|&lt;\\omega),\\\\\n\\operatorname{FreeFor}(t,v,\\theta)\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\top\n\\quad(\\theta\\in\\operatorname{Atom}(\\mathcal L)),\\\\\n\\operatorname{FreeFor}(t,v,\\neg\\phi)\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\operatorname{FreeFor}(t,v,\\phi),\\\\\n\\operatorname{FreeFor}(t,v,\\phi\\to\\psi)\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\\n\\operatorname{FreeFor}(t,v,\\phi)\\land\\operatorname{FreeFor}(t,v,\\psi),\\\\\n\\operatorname{FreeFor}(t,v,\\forall w\\phi)\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\\nv=w\\lor v\\notin\\operatorname{FV}(\\phi)\\lor\n(w\\notin\\operatorname{FV}(t)\\land\\operatorname{FreeFor}(t,v,\\phi)).\n\\end{gathered}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{gathered}\n\\operatorname{sz}(v):=1,\\qquad\n\\operatorname{sz}((f,(t_i)_{i&lt;a_F(f)})):=1+\\sum_{i&lt;a_F(f)}\\operatorname{sz}(t_i),\\\\\n\\operatorname{sz}((=,t,u)):=1+\\operatorname{sz}(t)+\\operatorname{sz}(u),\\qquad\n\\operatorname{sz}((r,(t_i)_{i&lt;a_R(r)})):=1+\\sum_{i&lt;a_R(r)}\\operatorname{sz}(t_i),\\\\\n\\operatorname{sz}(\\neg\\phi):=1+\\operatorname{sz}(\\phi),\\qquad\n\\operatorname{sz}(\\phi\\to\\psi):=1+\\operatorname{sz}(\\phi)+\\operatorname{sz}(\\psi),\\qquad\n\\operatorname{sz}(\\forall v\\phi):=1+\\operatorname{sz}(\\phi),\\\\\n\\operatorname{Ren}_{z,w}(v):=\\begin{cases}z&amp;v=w,\\\\v&amp;v\\ne w,\\end{cases}\\\\\n\\operatorname{Ren}_{z,w}((f,(t_i)_{i&lt;a_F(f)})):=\n(f,(\\operatorname{Ren}_{z,w}(t_i))_{i&lt;a_F(f)}),\\\\\n\\operatorname{Ren}_{z,w}((=,t,u)):=\n(=,\\operatorname{Ren}_{z,w}(t),\\operatorname{Ren}_{z,w}(u)),\\\\\n\\operatorname{Ren}_{z,w}((r,(t_i)_{i&lt;a_R(r)})):=\n(r,(\\operatorname{Ren}_{z,w}(t_i))_{i&lt;a_R(r)}),\\\\\n\\operatorname{Ren}_{z,w}(\\neg\\phi):=\\neg\\operatorname{Ren}_{z,w}(\\phi),\\qquad\n\\operatorname{Ren}_{z,w}(\\phi\\to\\psi):=\n\\operatorname{Ren}_{z,w}(\\phi)\\to\\operatorname{Ren}_{z,w}(\\psi),\\\\\n\\operatorname{Ren}_{z,w}(\\forall v\\phi):=\n\\begin{cases}\\forall v\\phi&amp;v=w,\\\\\n\\forall v\\operatorname{Ren}_{z,w}(\\phi)&amp;v\\ne w,\n\\end{cases}\\\\\n\\operatorname{sz}:\\operatorname{Term}(\\mathcal L)\\cup\\operatorname{Form}(\\mathcal L)\\to\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{sz}(\\operatorname{Ren}_{z,w}(\\xi))=\\operatorname{sz}(\\xi)\n\\quad(\\xi\\in\\operatorname{Term}(\\mathcal L)\\cup\\operatorname{Form}(\\mathcal L)),\\\\\n\\operatorname{sz}(\\operatorname{Ren}_{z,w}(\\phi))&lt;\\operatorname{sz}(\\forall w\\phi).\n\\end{gathered}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{gathered}\n\\operatorname{sz}(v):=1,\\qquad\n\\operatorname{sz}((f,(t_i)_{i&lt;a_F(f)})):=1+\\sum_{i&lt;a_F(f)}\\operatorname{sz}(t_i),\\\\\n\\operatorname{sz}((=,t,u)):=1+\\operatorname{sz}(t)+\\operatorname{sz}(u),\\qquad\n\\operatorname{sz}((r,(t_i)_{i&lt;a_R(r)})):=1+\\sum_{i&lt;a_R(r)}\\operatorname{sz}(t_i),\\\\\n\\operatorname{sz}(\\neg\\phi):=1+\\operatorname{sz}(\\phi),\\qquad\n\\operatorname{sz}(\\phi\\to\\psi):=1+\\operatorname{sz}(\\phi)+\\operatorname{sz}(\\psi),\\qquad\n\\operatorname{sz}(\\forall v\\phi):=1+\\operatorname{sz}(\\phi),\\\\\n\\operatorname{Ren}_{z,w}(v):=\\begin{cases}z&amp;v=w,\\\\v&amp;v\\ne w,\\end{cases}\\\\\n\\operatorname{Ren}_{z,w}((f,(t_i)_{i&lt;a_F(f)})):=\n(f,(\\operatorname{Ren}_{z,w}(t_i))_{i&lt;a_F(f)}),\\\\\n\\operatorname{Ren}_{z,w}((=,t,u)):=\n(=,\\operatorname{Ren}_{z,w}(t),\\operatorname{Ren}_{z,w}(u)),\\\\\n\\operatorname{Ren}_{z,w}((r,(t_i)_{i&lt;a_R(r)})):=\n(r,(\\operatorname{Ren}_{z,w}(t_i))_{i&lt;a_R(r)}),\\\\\n\\operatorname{Ren}_{z,w}(\\neg\\phi):=\\neg\\operatorname{Ren}_{z,w}(\\phi),\\qquad\n\\operatorname{Ren}_{z,w}(\\phi\\to\\psi):=\n\\operatorname{Ren}_{z,w}(\\phi)\\to\\operatorname{Ren}_{z,w}(\\psi),\\\\\n\\operatorname{Ren}_{z,w}(\\forall v\\phi):=\n\\begin{cases}\\forall v\\phi&amp;v=w,\\\\\n\\forall v\\operatorname{Ren}_{z,w}(\\phi)&amp;v\\ne w,\n\\end{cases}\\\\\n\\operatorname{sz}:\\operatorname{Term}(\\mathcal L)\\cup\\operatorname{Form}(\\mathcal L)\\to\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{sz}(\\operatorname{Ren}_{z,w}(\\xi))=\\operatorname{sz}(\\xi)\n\\quad(\\xi\\in\\operatorname{Term}(\\mathcal L)\\cup\\operatorname{Form}(\\mathcal L)),\\\\\n\\operatorname{sz}(\\operatorname{Ren}_{z,w}(\\phi))&lt;\\operatorname{sz}(\\forall w\\phi).\n\\end{gathered}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{gathered}\nu[t/v]:=\\begin{cases}t&amp;u=v,\\\\u&amp;u\\ne v\\end{cases}\\quad(u\\in\\mathrm{Var}),\\\\\n(f,(t_i))[t/v]:=(f,(t_i[t/v])_i),\\qquad\n(=,u_0,u_1)[t/v]:=(=,u_0[t/v],u_1[t/v]),\\\\\n(r,(t_i))[t/v]:=(r,(t_i[t/v])_i),\\quad\n(\\neg\\phi)[t/v]:=\\neg(\\phi[t/v]),\\quad\n(\\phi\\to\\psi)[t/v]:=\\phi[t/v]\\to\\psi[t/v],\\\\\nz(t,v,w,\\phi):=\\operatorname{Fresh}(\\operatorname{AV}(\\phi)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}(t)\\cup\\{v,w\\}),\\\\\n(\\forall w\\phi)[t/v]:=\n\\begin{cases}\n\\forall w\\phi&amp;w=v\\lor v\\notin\\operatorname{FV}(\\phi),\\\\\n\\forall w(\\phi[t/v])&amp;w\\ne v\\land v\\in\\operatorname{FV}(\\phi)\\land w\\notin\\operatorname{FV}(t),\\\\\n\\forall z(t,v,w,\\phi)\\bigl((\\operatorname{Ren}_{z(t,v,w,\\phi),w}(\\phi))[t/v]\\bigr)\n&amp;w\\ne v\\land v\\in\\operatorname{FV}(\\phi)\\land w\\in\\operatorname{FV}(t).\n\\end{cases}\\\\\n\\operatorname{All}((),\\phi):=\\phi,\\qquad\n\\operatorname{All}((v)^\\frown\\vec w,\\phi):=\\forall v\\operatorname{All}(\\vec w,\\phi),\\\\\n\\operatorname{UC}(\\phi):=\\operatorname{All}((v_i)_{i\\in E_\\phi}^{\\uparrow},\\phi),\\qquad\nE_\\phi:=\\{i\\in\\omega:v_i\\in\\operatorname{FV}(\\phi)\\}.\n\\end{gathered}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{gathered}\nu[t/v]:=\\begin{cases}t&amp;u=v,\\\\u&amp;u\\ne v\\end{cases}\\quad(u\\in\\mathrm{Var}),\\\\\n(f,(t_i))[t/v]:=(f,(t_i[t/v])_i),\\qquad\n(=,u_0,u_1)[t/v]:=(=,u_0[t/v],u_1[t/v]),\\\\\n(r,(t_i))[t/v]:=(r,(t_i[t/v])_i),\\quad\n(\\neg\\phi)[t/v]:=\\neg(\\phi[t/v]),\\quad\n(\\phi\\to\\psi)[t/v]:=\\phi[t/v]\\to\\psi[t/v],\\\\\nz(t,v,w,\\phi):=\\operatorname{Fresh}(\\operatorname{AV}(\\phi)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}(t)\\cup\\{v,w\\}),\\\\\n(\\forall w\\phi)[t/v]:=\n\\begin{cases}\n\\forall w\\phi&amp;w=v\\lor v\\notin\\operatorname{FV}(\\phi),\\\\\n\\forall w(\\phi[t/v])&amp;w\\ne v\\land v\\in\\operatorname{FV}(\\phi)\\land w\\notin\\operatorname{FV}(t),\\\\\n\\forall z(t,v,w,\\phi)\\bigl((\\operatorname{Ren}_{z(t,v,w,\\phi),w}(\\phi))[t/v]\\bigr)\n&amp;w\\ne v\\land v\\in\\operatorname{FV}(\\phi)\\land w\\in\\operatorname{FV}(t).\n\\end{cases}\\\\\n\\operatorname{All}((),\\phi):=\\phi,\\qquad\n\\operatorname{All}((v)^\\frown\\vec w,\\phi):=\\forall v\\operatorname{All}(\\vec w,\\phi),\\\\\n\\operatorname{UC}(\\phi):=\\operatorname{All}((v_i)_{i\\in E_\\phi}^{\\uparrow},\\phi),\\qquad\nE_\\phi:=\\{i\\in\\omega:v_i\\in\\operatorname{FV}(\\phi)\\}.\n\\end{gathered}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>本条对项和公式作相对于有效编码参数的定义。编码的选择可以不唯一，但须同时满足单射性、代码类别可判定以及所列构造／析构算法全可计算等条件。未选定具体实现时，不能从本条计算出 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\iota(v_0)\">\\(\\iota(v_0)\\)</span> 或 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa(v_0)\">\\(\\kappa(v_0)\\)</span> 究竟是哪个自然数；后续论述使用的是这组参数的性质。变量作为符号和作为叶子树具有不同的输入类型，并未要求 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\iota(v_0)=\\kappa(v_0)\">\\(\\iota(v_0)=\\kappa(v_0)\\)</span>。</p>\n<div class=\"table-scroll\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"表格\"><table><thead>\n<tr>\n<th>记号</th>\n<th>输入与输出</th>\n<th>作用</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\iota\">\\(\\iota\\)</span></td>\n<td>单个符号 → 自然数</td>\n<td>给变量、函数符号、关系符号或逻辑标签编号</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\">\\(\\kappa\\)</span></td>\n<td>整棵有限语法树 → 自然数</td>\n<td>给项、公式及其他有限标签树编号</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\nu\">\\(\\nu\\)</span></td>\n<td>变量下标 → 符号代码</td>\n<td>从 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i\">\\(i\\)</span> 得到 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\iota(v_i)\">\\(\\iota(v_i)\\)</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha_F,\\alpha_R\">\\(\\alpha_F,\\alpha_R\\)</span></td>\n<td>有效符号代码 → 元数</td>\n<td>读取函数或关系符号有几个参数</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf N\">\\(\\mathsf N\\)</span></td>\n<td>根标签与有序子树列 → 语法树</td>\n<td>在语法对象层组装树</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{build}\">\\(\\mathsf{build}\\)</span></td>\n<td>根符号代码与子树代码列表的序列码 → 树代码</td>\n<td>在自然数层组装树代码</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{root}\">\\(\\mathsf{root}\\)</span></td>\n<td>有效树代码 → 根符号代码</td>\n<td>读取树根</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{children}\">\\(\\mathsf{children}\\)</span></td>\n<td>有效树代码 → 子树代码列表的序列码</td>\n<td>读取有序直接子树列</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table></div><p>例如 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{root}(\\kappa(\\neg\\phi))=\\iota(\\neg)\">\\(\\mathsf{root}(\\kappa(\\neg\\phi))=\\iota(\\neg)\\)</span>：输入否定公式的整树代码，得到否定符号的代码。这里 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf N\">\\(\\mathsf N\\)</span> 操作树，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{build}\">\\(\\mathsf{build}\\)</span> 操作自然数；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{seqcode}\">\\(\\operatorname{seqcode}\\)</span> 只打包子树的代码列表。这些编码函数也不同于程序索引或句子枚举序号。</p>\n<p>替换的冲突分支先以结构递归的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Ren}\">\\(\\operatorname{Ren}\\)</span> 改名，再按 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{sz}\">\\(\\operatorname{sz}\\)</span> 的自然数值继续替换。改名保持大小，因此递归调用严格小于待处理的全称公式。在所选 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"z\\notin\\operatorname{AV}(\\phi)\">\\(z\\notin\\operatorname{AV}(\\phi)\\)</span> 时，改名结果逐字等于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\phi[z/w]\">\\(\\phi[z/w]\\)</span>；这里使用具体语法树和既定的新鲜变量规则，不对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha\">\\(\\alpha\\)</span> 等价类取商。</p>\n<p>来源：<a href=\"https://page-one.springer.com/pdf/preview/10.1007/978-3-642-31933-4_10\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Soare 2016，§10.1 Logical Background，印刷第 183 页</a> 假定可计算语言配有公式与句子的有效 Gödel 编码；<a href=\"https://link.springer.com/content/pdf/bfm%3A978-3-642-31933-4/1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">书前 Notation，印刷第 xxxi–xxxii 页</a> 给出有限对象的编码方法，并强调有效性和可逆性。上述 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\iota,\\kappa\">\\(\\iota,\\kappa\\)</span> 的记号、树接口、变量处理和替换递归是本地形式化展开，并非原书这几页逐项给出的定义。§10.1 的整本 PDF 第 215 页沿用既有记录。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-df-strings","status":"resolved","id":"755e421576224435","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-strings]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-computable","status":"resolved","id":"e343870c773cb68e","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-computable]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-recursive","status":"resolved","id":"d6dc5974baa6f8a5","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-recursive]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-finite-sequence-code","status":"resolved","id":"9885f96cf9cb2fff","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-finite-sequence-code]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-strings","status":"resolved","id":"755e421576224435","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-strings]]；see [[20-df-computable]]；see [[20-df-recursive]]；see [[20-df-finite-sequence-code]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-computable","status":"resolved","id":"e343870c773cb68e","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-strings]]；see [[20-df-computable]]；see [[20-df-recursive]]；see [[20-df-finite-sequence-code]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-recursive","status":"resolved","id":"d6dc5974baa6f8a5","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-strings]]；see [[20-df-computable]]；see [[20-df-recursive]]；see [[20-df-finite-sequence-code]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-finite-sequence-code","status":"resolved","id":"9885f96cf9cb2fff","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-strings]]；see [[20-df-computable]]；see [[20-df-recursive]]；see [[20-df-finite-sequence-code]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-finite-sequence-code","status":"resolved","id":"9885f96cf9cb2fff","anchor":"ref-9","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"这些数值函数在全部自然数输入上全定义；上式只约束对应有效语法数据的输入，无效输入上的输出不解释为语法对象。$\\operatorname{seqcode}$ 采用 [[20-df-finite-sequence-code]] 中的具体递归编码，只把已经得到的自然数代码排成有限列表；它不负责选择 $\\iota$ 或 $\\kappa$。同一语言上的下游语法计算沿用本条选定的整组编码及算法，不在计算过程中另换编号；改变语言时，须对相应的符号集与语法树重新明确这组参数的实例。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal L=(F,R,a_F,a_R)","display":false},{"tex":"F,R,\\mathrm{Var}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Var}=\\{v_i:i\\in\\omega\\}","display":false},{"tex":"a_F:F\\to\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"a_R:R\\to\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathscr T","display":false},{"tex":"t,u,u_0,u_1,t_i\\in\\operatorname{Term}(\\mathcal L)","display":false},{"tex":"\\phi,\\psi\\in\\operatorname{Form}(\\mathcal L)","display":false},{"tex":"v,w,z\\in\\mathrm{Var}","display":false},{"tex":"f\\in F","display":false},{"tex":"r\\in R","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal P(\\mathscr T)","display":false},{"tex":"\\neg\\phi","display":false},{"tex":"\\phi\\to\\psi","display":false},{"tex":"\\forall v\\phi","display":false},{"tex":"t=u","display":false},{"tex":"(\\neg,\\phi)","display":false},{"tex":"(\\to,\\phi,\\psi)","display":false},{"tex":"(\\forall,v,\\phi)","display":false},{"tex":"(=,t,u)","display":false},{"tex":"E\\subseteq\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"(v_i)_{i\\in E}^{\\uparrow}","display":false},{"tex":"\\vec w\\in\\mathrm{Var}^{<\\omega}","display":false},{"tex":"\\Lambda=\\{\\neg,\\to,\\forall,=\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\Gamma=F\\cup R\\cup\\mathrm{Var}\\cup\\Lambda","display":false},{"tex":"\\iota:\\Gamma\\hookrightarrow\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\kappa:\\mathscr T\\hookrightarrow\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\iota(a)","display":false},{"tex":"a","display":false},{"tex":"\\kappa(\\xi)","display":false},{"tex":"\\xi","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf N:\\Gamma\\times\\mathscr T^{<\\omega}\\to\\mathscr T","display":false},{"tex":"a\\in\\Gamma","display":false},{"tex":"\\vec\\xi\\in\\mathscr T^{<\\omega}","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{gathered}\n\\mathsf N(v,())=v,\\qquad\n\\mathsf N(f,(t_i)_{i<a_F(f)})=(f,(t_i)_{i<a_F(f)}),\\qquad\n\\mathsf N(r,(t_i)_{i<a_R(r)})=(r,(t_i)_{i<a_R(r)}),\\\\\n\\mathsf N(=,(t,u))=(=,t,u),\\qquad\n\\mathsf N(\\neg,(\\phi))=(\\neg,\\phi),\\\\\n\\mathsf N(\\to,(\\phi,\\psi))=(\\to,\\phi,\\psi),\\qquad\n\\mathsf N(\\forall,(v,\\phi))=(\\forall,v,\\phi).\n\\end{gathered}","display":true},{"tex":"\\nu,\\alpha_F,\\alpha_R,\\mathsf{root},\\mathsf{children}\\in\\mathcal C_1^{\\mathrm{tot}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{build}\\in\\mathcal C_2^{\\mathrm{tot}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\iota,\\kappa","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{gathered}\n\\iota[F],\\ \\iota[R],\\ \\iota[\\mathrm{Var}],\\ \\iota[\\Lambda],\\ \\kappa[\\mathscr T]\\in\\mathcal R,\\\\\n\\forall i\\in\\omega\\ [\\nu(i)=\\iota(v_i)],\\qquad\n\\forall f\\in F\\ [\\alpha_F(\\iota(f))=a_F(f)],\\qquad\n\\forall r\\in R\\ [\\alpha_R(\\iota(r))=a_R(r)],\\\\\n\\forall m\\in\\omega\\ \\forall a\\in\\Gamma\\ \\forall(\\xi_i)_{i<m}\\in\\mathscr T^m\\\n\\left[\\begin{gathered}\n\\mathsf{build}\\bigl(\\iota(a),\\operatorname{seqcode}((\\kappa(\\xi_i))_{i<m})\\bigr)\n=\\kappa(\\mathsf N(a,(\\xi_i)_{i<m})),\\\\\n\\mathsf{root}(\\kappa(\\mathsf N(a,(\\xi_i)_{i<m})))=\\iota(a),\\\\\n\\mathsf{children}(\\kappa(\\mathsf N(a,(\\xi_i)_{i<m})))\n=\\operatorname{seqcode}((\\kappa(\\xi_i))_{i<m})\n\\end{gathered}\\right].\n\\end{gathered}","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{seqcode}","display":false},{"tex":"\\iota","display":false},{"tex":"\\kappa","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}formula}\\vdash\n\\begin{gathered}\n\\operatorname{Term}(\\mathcal L):=\\bigcap\\{T\\subseteq\\mathscr T:\n\\mathrm{Var}\\subseteq T\\land\n\\forall f\\in F\\ \\forall(t_i)_{i<a_F(f)}\\in T^{a_F(f)}\\\n[(f,(t_i))\\in T]\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{Atom}(\\mathcal L):=\n\\{(=,t,u):t,u\\in\\operatorname{Term}(\\mathcal L)\\}\n\\cup\\{(r,(t_i)):r\\in R,\\ (t_i)\\in\\operatorname{Term}(\\mathcal L)^{a_R(r)}\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{Form}(\\mathcal L):=\\bigcap\\{S\\subseteq\\mathscr T:\n\\operatorname{Atom}(\\mathcal L)\\subseteq S\\land\n\\forall\\phi,\\psi\\in S\\ \\forall v\\in\\mathrm{Var}\\\n[(\\neg,\\phi),(\\to,\\phi,\\psi),(\\forall,v,\\phi)\\in S]\\}.\n\\end{gathered}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{gathered}\n\\operatorname{FV}(v):=\\{v\\},\\qquad\n\\operatorname{FV}((f,(t_i)_{i<a_F(f)})):=\\bigcup_{i<a_F(f)}\\operatorname{FV}(t_i),\\\\\n\\operatorname{FV}((=,t,u)):=\\operatorname{FV}(t)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}(u),\\qquad\n\\operatorname{FV}((r,(t_i)_{i<a_R(r)})):=\\bigcup_{i<a_R(r)}\\operatorname{FV}(t_i),\\\\\n\\operatorname{FV}(\\neg\\phi):=\\operatorname{FV}(\\phi),\\quad\n\\operatorname{FV}(\\phi\\to\\psi):=\\operatorname{FV}(\\phi)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}(\\psi),\\quad\n\\operatorname{FV}(\\forall v\\phi):=\\operatorname{FV}(\\phi)\\setminus\\{v\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{Sent}(\\mathcal L):=\\{\\phi\\in\\operatorname{Form}(\\mathcal L):\\operatorname{FV}(\\phi)=\\varnothing\\},\\\\\n\\phi\\land\\psi:=(\\neg,(\\to,\\phi,(\\neg,\\psi))),\\qquad\n\\phi\\lor\\psi:=(\\to,(\\neg,\\phi),\\psi),\\\\\n\\exists v\\phi:=(\\neg,(\\forall,v,(\\neg,\\phi))),\\qquad\n\\phi\\leftrightarrow\\psi:=(\\phi\\to\\psi)\\land(\\psi\\to\\phi),\\qquad\n(t\\ne u):=\\neg(t=u).\n\\end{gathered}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{gathered}\n\\operatorname{AV}(v):=\\{v\\},\\quad\n\\operatorname{AV}((f,(t_i))):=\\bigcup_i\\operatorname{AV}(t_i),\\\\\n\\operatorname{AV}((=,t,u)):=\\operatorname{AV}(t)\\cup\\operatorname{AV}(u),\\quad\n\\operatorname{AV}((r,(t_i))):=\\bigcup_i\\operatorname{AV}(t_i),\\\\\n\\operatorname{AV}(\\neg\\phi):=\\operatorname{AV}(\\phi),\\quad\n\\operatorname{AV}(\\phi\\to\\psi):=\\operatorname{AV}(\\phi)\\cup\\operatorname{AV}(\\psi),\\quad\n\\operatorname{AV}(\\forall v\\phi):=\\{v\\}\\cup\\operatorname{AV}(\\phi),\\\\\n\\operatorname{Fresh}(E):=v_{\\min\\{i\\in\\omega:v_i\\notin E\\}}\n\\quad(E\\subseteq\\mathrm{Var},\\ |E|<\\omega),\\\\\n\\operatorname{FreeFor}(t,v,\\theta)\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\top\n\\quad(\\theta\\in\\operatorname{Atom}(\\mathcal L)),\\\\\n\\operatorname{FreeFor}(t,v,\\neg\\phi)\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\operatorname{FreeFor}(t,v,\\phi),\\\\\n\\operatorname{FreeFor}(t,v,\\phi\\to\\psi)\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\\n\\operatorname{FreeFor}(t,v,\\phi)\\land\\operatorname{FreeFor}(t,v,\\psi),\\\\\n\\operatorname{FreeFor}(t,v,\\forall w\\phi)\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\\nv=w\\lor v\\notin\\operatorname{FV}(\\phi)\\lor\n(w\\notin\\operatorname{FV}(t)\\land\\operatorname{FreeFor}(t,v,\\phi)).\n\\end{gathered}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{gathered}\n\\operatorname{sz}(v):=1,\\qquad\n\\operatorname{sz}((f,(t_i)_{i<a_F(f)})):=1+\\sum_{i<a_F(f)}\\operatorname{sz}(t_i),\\\\\n\\operatorname{sz}((=,t,u)):=1+\\operatorname{sz}(t)+\\operatorname{sz}(u),\\qquad\n\\operatorname{sz}((r,(t_i)_{i<a_R(r)})):=1+\\sum_{i<a_R(r)}\\operatorname{sz}(t_i),\\\\\n\\operatorname{sz}(\\neg\\phi):=1+\\operatorname{sz}(\\phi),\\qquad\n\\operatorname{sz}(\\phi\\to\\psi):=1+\\operatorname{sz}(\\phi)+\\operatorname{sz}(\\psi),\\qquad\n\\operatorname{sz}(\\forall v\\phi):=1+\\operatorname{sz}(\\phi),\\\\\n\\operatorname{Ren}_{z,w}(v):=\\begin{cases}z&v=w,\\\\v&v\\ne w,\\end{cases}\\\\\n\\operatorname{Ren}_{z,w}((f,(t_i)_{i<a_F(f)})):=\n(f,(\\operatorname{Ren}_{z,w}(t_i))_{i<a_F(f)}),\\\\\n\\operatorname{Ren}_{z,w}((=,t,u)):=\n(=,\\operatorname{Ren}_{z,w}(t),\\operatorname{Ren}_{z,w}(u)),\\\\\n\\operatorname{Ren}_{z,w}((r,(t_i)_{i<a_R(r)})):=\n(r,(\\operatorname{Ren}_{z,w}(t_i))_{i<a_R(r)}),\\\\\n\\operatorname{Ren}_{z,w}(\\neg\\phi):=\\neg\\operatorname{Ren}_{z,w}(\\phi),\\qquad\n\\operatorname{Ren}_{z,w}(\\phi\\to\\psi):=\n\\operatorname{Ren}_{z,w}(\\phi)\\to\\operatorname{Ren}_{z,w}(\\psi),\\\\\n\\operatorname{Ren}_{z,w}(\\forall v\\phi):=\n\\begin{cases}\\forall v\\phi&v=w,\\\\\n\\forall v\\operatorname{Ren}_{z,w}(\\phi)&v\\ne w,\n\\end{cases}\\\\\n\\operatorname{sz}:\\operatorname{Term}(\\mathcal L)\\cup\\operatorname{Form}(\\mathcal L)\\to\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{sz}(\\operatorname{Ren}_{z,w}(\\xi))=\\operatorname{sz}(\\xi)\n\\quad(\\xi\\in\\operatorname{Term}(\\mathcal L)\\cup\\operatorname{Form}(\\mathcal L)),\\\\\n\\operatorname{sz}(\\operatorname{Ren}_{z,w}(\\phi))<\\operatorname{sz}(\\forall w\\phi).\n\\end{gathered}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{gathered}\nu[t/v]:=\\begin{cases}t&u=v,\\\\u&u\\ne v\\end{cases}\\quad(u\\in\\mathrm{Var}),\\\\\n(f,(t_i))[t/v]:=(f,(t_i[t/v])_i),\\qquad\n(=,u_0,u_1)[t/v]:=(=,u_0[t/v],u_1[t/v]),\\\\\n(r,(t_i))[t/v]:=(r,(t_i[t/v])_i),\\quad\n(\\neg\\phi)[t/v]:=\\neg(\\phi[t/v]),\\quad\n(\\phi\\to\\psi)[t/v]:=\\phi[t/v]\\to\\psi[t/v],\\\\\nz(t,v,w,\\phi):=\\operatorname{Fresh}(\\operatorname{AV}(\\phi)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}(t)\\cup\\{v,w\\}),\\\\\n(\\forall w\\phi)[t/v]:=\n\\begin{cases}\n\\forall w\\phi&w=v\\lor v\\notin\\operatorname{FV}(\\phi),\\\\\n\\forall w(\\phi[t/v])&w\\ne v\\land v\\in\\operatorname{FV}(\\phi)\\land w\\notin\\operatorname{FV}(t),\\\\\n\\forall z(t,v,w,\\phi)\\bigl((\\operatorname{Ren}_{z(t,v,w,\\phi),w}(\\phi))[t/v]\\bigr)\n&w\\ne v\\land v\\in\\operatorname{FV}(\\phi)\\land w\\in\\operatorname{FV}(t).\n\\end{cases}\\\\\n\\operatorname{All}((),\\phi):=\\phi,\\qquad\n\\operatorname{All}((v)^\\frown\\vec w,\\phi):=\\forall v\\operatorname{All}(\\vec w,\\phi),\\\\\n\\operatorname{UC}(\\phi):=\\operatorname{All}((v_i)_{i\\in E_\\phi}^{\\uparrow},\\phi),\\qquad\nE_\\phi:=\\{i\\in\\omega:v_i\\in\\operatorname{FV}(\\phi)\\}.\n\\end{gathered}","display":true},{"tex":"\\iota(v_0)","display":false},{"tex":"\\kappa(v_0)","display":false},{"tex":"\\iota(v_0)=\\kappa(v_0)","display":false},{"tex":"\\iota","display":false},{"tex":"\\kappa","display":false},{"tex":"\\nu","display":false},{"tex":"i","display":false},{"tex":"\\iota(v_i)","display":false},{"tex":"\\alpha_F,\\alpha_R","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf N","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{build}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{root}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{children}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{root}(\\kappa(\\neg\\phi))=\\iota(\\neg)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf N","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{build}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{seqcode}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Ren}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{sz}","display":false},{"tex":"z\\notin\\operatorname{AV}(\\phi)","display":false},{"tex":"\\phi[z/w]","display":false},{"tex":"\\alpha","display":false},{"tex":"\\iota,\\kappa","display":false}],"bytes":12667,"backlinks":[{"id":"67ae4f0c8e4d1ac7","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":3,"excerpt":"$k\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}$；$\\dot f$ 是本条固定的一元函数标签，与 $F_{PA}$、变量及逻辑标签不交。$\\mathcal L_{PA,f}$ 的下标 f 指该语法标签；量词中的 $f\\in\\omega^\\omega$ 是解释该标签的全自然数函数，两者不混同。$\\vec n\\in\\omega^k$。下列固定扩展语言的语法及有效编码采用 [[20-df-formula]] 的相应参数实例；这组参数不随解释函数 $f$ 改变。"},{"id":"8372bbf882660759","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":3,"excerpt":"$\\mathcal L=(F,R,a_F,a_R)$ 采用 [[20-df-formula]] 的有效签名，以及在本语言上已选定的一组符号编码、语法树编码和有效构造／析构算法；$\\phi,\\psi,\\theta\\in\\operatorname{Form}(\\mathcal L)$；$v\\in\\mathrm{Var}$；$t,u$ 为项；FreeFor 表示递归替换中没有自由变量被捕获；FV 为按语法树递归所得自由变量集。"},{"id":"379df91db6a6f0af","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":3,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-formula]]；see [[20-df-pa]]；see [[20-df-provable]]；see [[20-df-classical-proof-system]]。"},{"id":"2772d51949360c14","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":4,"excerpt":"$\\mathcal L_{RB}=(F_{RB},R_{RB},a_{F,RB},a_{R,RB})$ 为固定的有效语言，采用 [[20-df-formula]] 在本语言上选定的一组符号编码、语法树编码及有效算法参数；$F_{PA}\\subseteq F_{RB}$，$a_{F,RB}\\upharpoonright F_{PA}=a_{F,PA}$。$\\dot R,\\dot B\\in R_{RB}$ 是不同标签，且 $a_{R,RB}(\\dot R)=a_{R,RB}(\\dot B)=2$。这组语言及编码参数在同一个游戏环境中保持固定。"},{"id":"4e01ee20e163d443","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":3,"excerpt":"$\\dot0,\\dot S,\\dot+,\\dot\\times$ 为固定的四个算术语法标签，点号用来区分语法符号与其解释。其符号代码与语法树代码采用 [[20-df-formula]] 在下列语言 $\\mathcal L_{PA}$ 上选定的一组有效编码参数；本条不另行指定具体编号。它们与变量和逻辑标签不交。项位置的 $0,S,+,\\times$ 采用下文给出的构造子记法。$x=v_0$、$y=v_1$ 是不同变量；归纳模式中 x 仍遍历全部变量。"},{"id":"ea674d0eb2839a85","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":3,"excerpt":"$\\mathcal L=(F,R,a_F,a_R)$ 采用 [[20-df-formula]] 的有效签名，以及在本语言上已选定的一组符号编码、语法树编码和有效构造／析构算法；$p\\in\\operatorname{Form}(\\mathcal L)^{<\\omega}$；$\\phi\\in\\operatorname{Form}(\\mathcal L)$。"},{"id":"d4a7833057f5a20e","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":3,"excerpt":"$\\mathcal L=(F,R,a_F,a_R)$ 采用 [[20-df-formula]] 的签名和有限语法树；所涉语法编码沿用本语言上已固定的一组参数；$D\\ne\\varnothing$。$\\mathfrak M=(D,I,J)$，其中 I 的定义域为 F，J 的定义域为 R；对每个 $f\\in F$、$r\\in R$，$I(f):D^{a_F(f)}\\to D$，$J(r)\\subseteq D^{a_R(r)}$。原记号 $f^{\\mathfrak M}=I(f)$、$r^{\\mathfrak M}=J(r)$ 保持不变；零元函数也按定义域为 $D^0=\\{()\\}$ 的函数解释。"},{"id":"a6a902146de6a471","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":3,"excerpt":"$\\dot\\le$ 是下列固定语言中的唯一二元关系标签；其项与公式采用 [[20-df-formula]] 的语法及该语言上选定的有效编码参数；它与变量及逻辑标签不交。$\\mathcal R_{\\mathrm{deg}}$ 为 c.e. 度载体，$\\le$ 为其继承的度顺序；$L_n,H_n$ 沿用原低度和高度族。$\\operatorname{Form}_1$ 的下标 1 表示唯一自由变量为 $v_0$。$\\mathfrak R\\models\\theta[\\mathbf a]$ 保留为单元素元组赋值的记法。"}],"outgoing":["755e421576224435","e343870c773cb68e","d6dc5974baa6f8a5","9885f96cf9cb2fff"]}